<title>USA: Coinmach acquires laundry companies.</title>
<headline>Coinmach acquires laundry companies.</headline>
<dateline>ROSLYN, N.Y. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coinmach Laundry Corp said on Wednesday it acquired National Coin Laundry Holding's operations for $19 million cash.</p>
<p>National Coin Laundry provides coin operated laundry equipment for apartment and townhouses and distributes commercial laundry equipment to laundromats.</p>
<p>National Coin Laundry's operations are primarily in the midwest and had 1996 revenues of $14.0 million.</p>
</text>
